"<p>The Python engine's audio queued in the output device ahead of what is"
" heard. Smaller answers sooner (play, pause, seek, CUE calls, volume, "
"tempo); too small drops out when the computer is busy (with the time "
"stretch, below about 80 ms).</p>"
